{
    "chapter_num": 21,
    "verses_count": 27,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "All Things Made New"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now I saw a new heaven and a new earth, for the first heaven and the first earth had passed away. Also there was no more sea. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then I, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU, M omit John"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "John, saw the holy city, New Jerusalem, coming down out of heaven from God, prepared as a bride adorned for her husband. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And I heard a loud voice from heaven saying, “Behold, the tabernacle of God "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " with men, and He will dwell with them, and they shall be His people. God Himself will be with them "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "and be"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " their God. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And God will wipe away every tear from their eyes; there shall be no more death, nor sorrow, nor crying. There shall be no more pain, for the former things have passed away.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then He who sat on the throne said, “Behold, I make all things new.” And He said "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU, M omit to me"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "to me, “Write, for these words are true and faithful.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And He said to me, “It"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "M omits It is done"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " is done! I am the Alpha and the Omega, the Beginning and the End. I will give of the fountain of the water of life freely to him who thirsts. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "He who overcomes "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "M I shall give him these things"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "shall inherit all things, and I will be his God and he shall be My son. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But the cowardly, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "M adds and sinners,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "unbelieving, abominable, murderers, sexually immoral, sorcerers, idolaters, and all liars shall have their part in the lake which burns with fire and brimstone, which is the second death.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The New Jerusalem"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then one of the seven angels who had the seven bowls filled with the seven last plagues came "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU, M omit to me"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "to me and talked with me, saying, “Come, I will show you the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "M woman, the Lamb’s bride"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "bride, the Lamb’s wife.” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And he carried me away in the Spirit to a great and high mountain, and showed me the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU, M omit great"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "great city, the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU, M holy city, Jerusalem"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "holy Jerusalem, descending out of heaven from God, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "having the glory of God. Her light "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " like a most precious stone, like a jasper stone, clear as crystal. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Also she had a great and high wall with twelve gates, and twelve angels at the gates, and names written on them, which are "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "the names"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of the twelve tribes of the children of Israel: "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "three gates on the east, three gates on the north, three gates on the south, and three gates on the west."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now the wall of the city had twelve foundations, and on them were the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU, M twelve names"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "names of the twelve apostles of the Lamb. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And he who talked with me had a gold reed to measure the city, its gates, and its wall. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "The city is laid out as a square; its length is as great as its breadth. And he measured the city with the reed: twelve thousand "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. stadia, about 1,380 miles in all"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "furlongs. Its length, breadth, and height are equal. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then he measured its wall: one hundred "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "and"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " forty-four cubits, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "according"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " to the measure of a man, that is, of an angel. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "The construction of its wall was "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "of"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " jasper; and the city "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " pure gold, like clear glass. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 19,
                    "num_str": "19",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "The foundations of the wall of the city "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " adorned with all kinds of precious stones: the first foundation "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " jasper, the second sapphire, the third chalcedony, the fourth emerald, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 20,
                    "num_str": "20",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "the fifth sardonyx, the sixth sardius, the seventh chrysolite, the eighth beryl, the ninth topaz, the tenth chrysoprase, the eleventh jacinth, and the twelfth amethyst. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 21,
                    "num_str": "21",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "The twelve gates "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " twelve pearls: each individual gate was of one pearl. And the street of the city "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " pure gold, like transparent glass."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Glory of the New Jerusalem"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 22,
                    "num_str": "22",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But I saw no temple in it, for the Lord God Almighty and the Lamb are its temple. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 23,
                    "num_str": "23",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "The city had no need of the sun or of the moon to shine "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU, M omit in it"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "in it, for the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "M very glory"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "glory of God illuminated it. The Lamb "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " its light. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 24,
                    "num_str": "24",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And the nations "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU, M omit of those who are saved"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "of those who are saved shall walk in its light, and the kings of the earth bring their glory and honor "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "M of the nations to Him"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "into it. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 25,
                    "num_str": "25",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Its gates shall not be shut at all by day (there shall be no night there). "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 26,
                    "num_str": "26",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And they shall bring the glory and the honor of the nations into "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "M adds that they may enter in."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "it. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 27,
                    "num_str": "27",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But there shall by no means enter it anything "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU, M profane, nor one who causes"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "that defiles, or causes an abomination or a lie, but only those who are written in the Lamb’s Book of Life."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}